Find self-hosted programs with bounty language
inurl:"/.well-known/security.txt" "bounty"

Catches programs using reward instead of bounty
inurl:"/.well-known/security.txt" "reward"

Self-hosted programs with direct email contact
inurl:"/security.txt" "bug bounty" "mailto"

Responsible disclosure pages that pay
inurl:"/responsible-disclosure" "rewards"

VDP pages with bounty programs
inurl:"vulnerability-disclosure-policy" "bounty"

Find programs that acknowledge researchers
inurl:"hall-of-fame" "security" "vulnerability"

Full programs with defined scope
inurl:"bug-bounty" "responsible disclosure" "scope"

