================================== Notes ====================================================

Replace target.com with the actual in-scope domain before running any dork
Always read the full policy before testing - scope varies wildly per program
Programs with direct email contact = lowest competition
Own portal (not on HackerOne/Bugcrowd) = very few hunters see it
security.txt expires field - always check the date before investing time
No safe harbor language in a policy = document everything and proceed carefully
Verify any program found via crawl is still active before starting recon